{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunged into a forgotten world of Darkness and Light, you must make this world your own by using it's resources to return balance to it's inhabitants. Over time, collect stronger weapons and armour by fighting off enemies and looting chests, while also shaping the world to your need using pickaxes and axes. Once you are ready, summon and defeat the many bosses of darkness and light to restore order to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/cc252512a9ac9c798ed49277a15d78ef.poster.avif?t=1755328358\" width=600 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/cc252512a9ac9c798ed49277a15d78ef.webm?t=1755328358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/cc252512a9ac9c798ed49277a15d78ef.mp4?t=1755328358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the hundreds of twisting cave systems underground complete with tons of enemies, ores, and loot. Always remember to bring plenty of torches, the darkness can be very dangerous...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/0b92695d9de6cbf326baa8d1f114866c.poster.avif?t=1755328358\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/0b92695d9de6cbf326baa8d1f114866c.webm?t=1755328358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/0b92695d9de6cbf326baa8d1f114866c.mp4?t=1755328358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip tons of Swords, Daggers, Helmets, Chestplates, Rings, and much more during your journey! Gain special bonus stats for every piece of equipment to use when fighting enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/97d765fb0965a11011a780fc97e7f2db.poster.avif?t=1755328358\" width=600 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/97d765fb0965a11011a780fc97e7f2db.webm?t=1755328358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/97d765fb0965a11011a780fc97e7f2db.mp4?t=1755328358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover tons of unique structures scattered across the world, from ruins to towers, dungeons to catacombs, each with their own share of enemies and loot. All completely randomly generated with each world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/9ee90c9d0f48e72685e682ed6dfbce2a.poster.avif?t=1755328358\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/9ee90c9d0f48e72685e682ed6dfbce2a.webm?t=1755328358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368880/extras/9ee90c9d0f48e72685e682ed6dfbce2a.mp4?t=1755328358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamsta